Check that the responses contain the expected data, not just a successful HTTP status.
Step 10. Common problems
Error	What to check
ModuleNotFoundError	Correct environment, installed dependencies, project root, and imports
Database connection refused	PostgreSQL is running and connection settings are correct
Authentication failed	PostgreSQL username and password
relation does not exist	Database tables haven't been created or imported
Port 8000 already in use	Stop the other server or use a different port

